### CREATE EMP
POST http://localhost:5000/emp-api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"pavan",
    "email":"pavan@mail.com",
    "mobile":88888888,
    "designation":"developer",
    "companyName":"Infosys"
}


### READ ALL EMPS
GET http://localhost:5000/emp-api/employees

### UPDATE EMP BY ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/emp-api/employees/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"pavan",
    "email":"pavankumar@mail.com",
    "mobile":88888888,
    "designation":"developer",
    "companyName":"Infosys"
}

### DELETE EMP BY ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/emp-api/employees/:id